{"seq":2,"slug":"case-pack-ti-hi-spec","title":"箱规/装箱数/托盘层高（Ti-Hi）（联165）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/pack-hierarchy/case-pack-ti-hi-spec","wordCount":1875,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"箱规-装箱数-托盘层高-ti-hi-联165\">箱规/装箱数/托盘层高（Ti-Hi）（联165）</h1><p>供应商的箱规表上通常写着一行数字：&quot;12 × 6 × 8&quot;。它同时表达了三个事实：每箱 12 个、每层码 6 箱、码 8 层。前一个数是装箱数（pack size），后两个数合起来叫 Ti-Hi——Ti（Tiers）是每层箱数，Hi（High）是层数。这行数字的价值不在于描述，而在于<strong>可推导</strong>：由它应当能算出托盘总箱数、托盘净重、托盘体积，以及能否装进某个集装箱。</p>\n<p>一旦这条推导链被建立，收货、上架、装柜、报关四个环节就共享同一份事实；反之，箱规如果只是备注栏里的一段文字，每个环节都会自己算一遍，并且算出不同的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>箱规是一份<strong>可推导的规格</strong>而不是一组备注：给定六元组，托盘总箱数、净重、毛重、体积都应当是确定的函数值。它的价值来自这条推导链的<strong>唯一性</strong>——只要大家都从同一份箱规推导，四个环节得到的数字必然一致；一旦允许某处手工填写&quot;实际毛重&quot;，唯一性就破了。</p>\n<p>另一个关键性质是<strong>时间有效性</strong>：箱规会随供应商与产线变化，而历史运单的计费重与装载记录必须可解释。因此箱规的每一条记录都带生效期，任何时刻只有一个版本生效，任何历史时点都能还原当时的版本。收货校验尤其依赖这一点——它必须用收货当日生效的箱规来判断差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"箱规的构成\">箱规的构成</h2><h3 id=\"三个基本字段加两个约束\">三个基本字段加两个约束</h3><p>装箱数是&quot;一箱含多少个销售单元&quot;，Ti-Hi 是&quot;一托含多少箱&quot;。加上单箱的物理尺寸与重量，就得到了完整的箱规六元组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE case_spec (&#10;  case_spec_id     bigint GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_gtin        text NOT NULL REFERENCES trade_item(gtin),&#10;  pack_size        numeric(18,6) NOT NULL CHECK (pack_size &gt; 0),&#10;  ti_per_layer      int NOT NULL CHECK (ti_per_layer &gt; 0),&#10;  hi_layers         int NOT NULL CHECK (hi_layers &gt; 0),&#10;  case_length_mm   numeric(10,2) NOT NULL CHECK (case_length_mm &gt; 0),&#10;  case_width_mm    numeric(10,2) NOT NULL CHECK (case_width_mm &gt; 0),&#10;  case_height_mm   numeric(10,2) NOT NULL CHECK (case_height_mm &gt; 0),&#10;  case_gross_kg    numeric(12,6) NOT NULL CHECK (case_gross_kg &gt; 0),&#10;  case_tare_kg     numeric(12,6) NOT NULL CHECK (case_tare_kg &gt;= 0),&#10;  effective_from   date NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to     date,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_dim CHECK (case_height_mm &gt;= case_length_mm * 0.3)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_case_spec_current&#10;  ON case_spec (case_gtin) WHERE effective_to IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> case_spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_spec_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_gtin        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_item(gtin),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pack_size        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pack_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ti_per_layer      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ti_per_layer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hi_layers         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (hi_layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_length_mm   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (case_length_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_width_mm    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (case_width_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_height_mm   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (case_height_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_gross_kg    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (case_gross_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_tare_kg     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (case_tare_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (case_height_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_length_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_case_spec_current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_spec (case_gtin) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>chk_dim</code> 这条看似奇怪的约束拦的是一类真实错误：把长宽高填反。包装箱的高通常显著小于最长边（除立方体），若&quot;高&quot;大于最长边的 3 倍，几乎必然是填错了字段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"派生量的口径\">派生量的口径</h3><p>由六元组派生出托盘总箱数、托盘净重、托盘毛重与托盘体积。这些量<strong>必须派生而不是存储</strong>，理由与上一章相同——多处存储必然不一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>派生量</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>托盘总箱数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ti</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Hi</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ti} \\times \\text{Hi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ti</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hi</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>箱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘净重</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ti</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Hi</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>case_gross</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>case_tare</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ti} \\times \\text{Hi} \\times (\\text{case\\_gross} - \\text{case\\_tare})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ti</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">case_gross</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">case_tare</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘毛重</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ti</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Hi</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>case_gross</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>木质托盘自重</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ti} \\times \\text{Hi} \\times \\text{case\\_gross} + \\text{木质托盘自重}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ti</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">case_gross</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">木质托盘自重</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘体积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Ti</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>层深</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Hi</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{Ti} \\times w) \\times (\\text{层深} \\times l) \\times (\\text{Hi} \\times h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ti</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">层深</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>m³</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>体积公式里的&quot;层深&quot;指每层沿长边方向的箱数。Ti 有时被狭义地当作&quot;每层箱数&quot;，但当每层不是单排排列时，需要拆成两个方向的计数，因此更严谨的模型是把 Ti 拆为 <code>per_layer_x × per_layer_y</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"托盘自重的来源\">托盘自重的来源</h3><p>木质托盘的重量不是一个随意填的数：它取决于托盘类型与尺寸，且木质包装在跨境贸易中还受<strong>国际植物检疫措施标准 ISPM 15</strong> 的约束——实木托盘、木箱、垫木等必须经过标准规定的除害处理并加施 IPPC 标识；胶合板等经加工的木制品可以豁免（<a href=\"https://www.ippc.int/en/publications/640/\">IPPC ISPM 15</a>）。这条规则对本主题的影响有两处：一是托盘自重（与材质、尺寸相关）影响毛重申报与计费重；二是未经处理或标识不合规的木质包装会被目的国拒绝入境，因此<strong>托盘材质应作为主数据字段而非备注</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推导链-从箱规到可装载性\">推导链：从箱规到可装载性</h2><h3 id=\"集装箱匹配\">集装箱匹配</h3><p>箱规最有价值的下游用途是回答&quot;这一托能不能装柜、装几个&quot;。国际集装箱的尺寸以二十英尺等价单位（TEU，Twenty-foot Equivalent Unit）为标准计量，标准箱的内尺寸决定了可容纳的托盘数与码放方式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[case_spec 六元组] --&gt; B[托盘总箱数 = Ti x Hi]&#10;  A --&gt; C[托盘毛重]&#10;  A --&gt; D[托盘底面积 = per_layer_x x l 与 y x w]&#10;  B --&gt; E{托盘高 + 垫高 &lt;= 柜内高?}&#10;  D --&gt; F{柜内地板可放托盘数}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[降低 Hi 或改用矮箱]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| H[可装柜]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  C --&gt; I{总毛重 &lt;= 柜限重?}&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[受重量而非空间约束&lt;br/&gt;降托盘数]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[输出装柜方案参数]\">graph TD\n  A[case_spec 六元组] --&gt; B[托盘总箱数 = Ti x Hi]\n  A --&gt; C[托盘毛重]\n  A --&gt; D[托盘底面积 = per_layer_x x l 与 y x w]\n  B --&gt; E{托盘高 + 垫高 &lt;= 柜内高?}\n  D --&gt; F{柜内地板可放托盘数}\n  E --&gt;|否| G[降低 Hi 或改用矮箱]\n  E --&gt;|是| H[可装柜]\n  F --&gt; H\n  C --&gt; I{总毛重 &lt;= 柜限重?}\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt;|否| J[受重量而非空间约束&lt;br/&gt;降托盘数]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[输出装柜方案参数]</pre><p>这条链上最容易被忽略的是<strong>重量约束常常先于空间约束生效</strong>：高密度商品（液体、金属件）的托盘往往装不满柜就超重了，此时增加 Hi 毫无意义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"收货侧的逆向使用\">收货侧的逆向使用</h3><p>收货时箱规被反着用：扫描到托盘 SSCC，系统查出其 GTIN 关系，预期箱数与实际清点比对。差异有两种含义——少箱（可能短装）或多箱（可能混入他批）。若箱规本身是错的，这两种差异都会被误报，因此<strong>箱规变更必须有生效日期</strong>，收货校验用的是收货当日生效的版本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;receiving_check&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;against&quot;: &quot;case_spec_as_of_receipt_date&quot;,&#10;    &quot;expected_cases&quot;: &quot;ti_per_layer * hi_layers&quot;,&#10;    &quot;tolerance&quot;: { &quot;cases&quot;: 0, &quot;gross_weight_ratio&quot;: 0.02 },&#10;    &quot;on_mismatch&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cases&quot;: &quot;HOLD_AND_COUNT&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight&quot;: &quot;INVESTIGATE_ONLY&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;wood_packaging&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;ispm15_mark_required_for&quot;: [&quot;SOLID_WOOD&quot;],&#10;      &quot;exempt&quot;: [&quot;PLYWOOD&quot;, &quot;PROCESSED_WOOD&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"receiving_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"against\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"case_spec_as_of_receipt_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"expected_cases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ti_per_layer * hi_layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tolerance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"gross_weight_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_mismatch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HOLD_AND_COUNT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INVESTIGATE_ONLY\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"wood_packaging\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ispm15_mark_required_for\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SOLID_WOOD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"exempt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PLYWOOD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PROCESSED_WOOD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tolerance.cases</code> 为 0、<code>tolerance.gross_weight_ratio</code> 为 0.02，这个不对称是刻意的：箱数应当可以精确核对；毛重则受托盘含水率、缠绕膜、温度影响，允许 2% 的波动。把两者设成同一个容差，会导致要么箱数差异被掩盖，要么每天都在报假警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"箱规与其他主数据的关系\">箱规与其他主数据的关系</h2><h3 id=\"箱规不是单位换算\">箱规不是单位换算</h3><p>再次强调边界：<code>pack_size = 12</code> 不是一条换算因子。它的语义是&quot;这个 case GTIN 由 12 个 each GTIN 组成&quot;，属于 <a href=\"each-inner-case-pallet-hierarchy\">each/inner/case/pallet 包装层级</a> 的树结构。试图把它写进单位换算表，会得到一条&quot;MASS → COUNT&quot;的伪因子，进而让 <a href=\"../uom-customs-rounding/customs-statutory-uom-declare\">报关与法定检验计量单位映射</a> 里的法定单位推导出错。</p>\n<h3 id=\"箱规与起订量\">箱规与起订量</h3><p>箱规直接决定下单约束：既然货只能整箱发运，最小可购数量至少是一箱。起订量（MOQ）与整箱倍数这两条约束都建立在箱规之上，其实现见 <a href=\"moq-case-multiple-ordering\">起订量与整箱倍数下单约束</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"箱规与单位价格\">箱规与单位价格</h3><p>一箱 12 包、每包 454 克，消费者看到的单位价格是&quot;每千克多少钱&quot;，其分母来自 each 的净含量而非 case 的。箱规参与单位价格的唯一方式是<strong>整箱促销价</strong>的折算，见 <a href=\"../uom-pricing-inventory/unit-price-per-kg-l-oz\">每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"箱规变更的管理\">箱规变更的管理</h2><h3 id=\"变更的四种触发\">变更的四种触发</h3><p>装箱数变（供应商改内包装）、Ti 变（换托盘尺寸）、Hi 变（堆高限制调整）、尺寸重量变（换纸箱材质）。四种都要求新增一条 <code>case_spec</code> 并关闭旧记录，因为历史运单的计费重与装载记录必须可解释。</p>\n<h3 id=\"兼容性判定\">兼容性判定</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT c.case_gtin, c.pack_size, c.ti_per_layer, c.hi_layers,&#10;       c.effective_from,&#10;       ROUND(c.case_gross_kg - c.case_tare_kg, 6) AS case_net_kg,&#10;       ROUND((c.case_gross_kg - c.case_tare_kg)&#10;             * c.pack_size, 6) AS unit_net_kg_check&#10;FROM case_spec c&#10;JOIN trade_item e ON e.gtin = c.case_gtin&#10;JOIN trade_item u ON u.gtin = e.parent_gtin OR u.parent_gtin = e.gtin&#10;WHERE c.effective_to IS NULL&#10;  AND ABS((c.case_gross_kg - c.case_tare_kg) - e.net_content_qty) &gt; 0.001;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pack_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ti_per_layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hi_layers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_gross_kg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_tare_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_net_kg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_gross_kg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_tare_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pack_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_net_kg_check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_spec c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_item e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_gtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_item u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_gross_kg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_tare_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_content_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询找的是<strong>箱规与包装层级净含量不自洽</strong>的记录：一个箱子的净重减去内容物净重后应当接近零（差值即包装材料重量），若超过容差，说明箱规的 <code>case_tare_kg</code> 填错或 <code>pack_size</code> 与 each 净含量不匹配。把它做成日常巡检项，比等到报关短装被查要好得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>箱规由装箱数、Ti-Hi、单箱尺寸与重量构成；托盘总箱数、净重、体积等派生量必须计算而非存储。</li>\n<li>Ti 在多层排列场景下应拆成两个方向的每层箱数，否则体积与装载推导会偏。</li>\n<li>木质托盘的材质与 ISPM 15 处理状态是影响清关与毛重的主数据，不是备注。</li>\n<li>箱规变更必须新增记录并保留生效期，收货校验使用收货当日生效的版本；箱数与毛重的容差应分别设定。</li>\n<li>箱规是包装层级的规格，不是单位换算因子；把它混入单位表会污染法定单位推导。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下单侧的约束（起订量与整箱倍数）见下一篇 <a href=\"moq-case-multiple-ordering\">起订量与整箱倍数下单约束</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"箱规/装箱数/托盘层高（Ti-Hi）（联165）","id":"箱规-装箱数-托盘层高-ti-hi-联165"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"箱规的构成","id":"箱规的构成"},{"level":3,"text":"三个基本字段加两个约束","id":"三个基本字段加两个约束"},{"level":3,"text":"派生量的口径","id":"派生量的口径"},{"level":3,"text":"托盘自重的来源","id":"托盘自重的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"推导链：从箱规到可装载性","id":"推导链-从箱规到可装载性"},{"level":3,"text":"集装箱匹配","id":"集装箱匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"收货侧的逆向使用","id":"收货侧的逆向使用"},{"level":2,"text":"箱规与其他主数据的关系","id":"箱规与其他主数据的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"箱规不是单位换算","id":"箱规不是单位换算"},{"level":3,"text":"箱规与起订量","id":"箱规与起订量"},{"level":3,"text":"箱规与单位价格","id":"箱规与单位价格"},{"level":2,"text":"箱规变更的管理","id":"箱规变更的管理"},{"level":3,"text":"变更的四种触发","id":"变更的四种触发"},{"level":3,"text":"兼容性判定","id":"兼容性判定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"each/inner/case/pallet 包装层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/pack-hierarchy/each-inner-case-pallet-hierarchy"},"next":{"title":"起订量/整箱倍数下单约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/pack-hierarchy/moq-case-multiple-ordering"}}